{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:62402b39143dcd42","name":"Coordinated Attack","source":{"id":"source:reference-62402b39143dcd42","title":"Coordinated Attack","revision":18054,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:30:50Z","sha256":"e9042c6cfa43d785f8dd6968decd936b827065ce71f5534a859635382a794f4e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18054","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Coordinated%20Attack&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-62402b39143dcd42","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at coordinating your attacks with your allies.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You are automatically successful when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to aid an ally's attack, or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Suppress an Enemy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Suppress_an_Enemy"}," as long as the target is adjacent to you or within Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may use this feat to aid an ally's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," attack. You can't use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," action to suppress a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", but you can suppress an individual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," (such as the lead ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," for a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Battery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Battery"},"). You may use this feat even if you are using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"}," using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"}," using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," You must make an attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10 to gain the benefits of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," action.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
